{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'ROOST' is a brief atmospheric First Person Horror-Exploration game, set in the fictional North-East English town of Mournbrough - a place harbouring dark secrets and seemingly lost to time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Player assumes the role of Declan Harker; a down-on-his-luck paranormal investigator who has been drawn to a haunting mystery where their quest for answers quickly spirals into a personal nightmare.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heavily inspired by\u00a0<i><u>P.T.</u></i>, <i><u>Paratopic</u></i><u>,\u00a0</u>\u00a0<i><u>Silent Hill</u></i>\u00a0, <u><i>Se7en</i></u>\u00a0and\u00a0<u><i>Lost Highway</i></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">| 'CRUEL BRITANNIA' ART DIRECTION |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/2024-07-2612-56-40-ezgif.com-effects.gif?t=1739471245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The games visual direction borrows heavily from PSX era, but channeled through a bleak vision of the forgotten realm of northern England.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">| IT'S GRIM UP NORTH |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A regional tale, set in the North-East of England. Inspired by the stories, perceptions and tales of the area. Welcome to Mournbrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/GhostSpook-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1739471245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">| ATMOSPHERIC WORLD AND SOUND DESIGN |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The town has many sights to see, and plenty of things you don't want to hear. Every nook and cranny has a story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/2024-07-2609-47-22-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1739471245\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">| MAKE CONVERSATION |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">People make the world go round. Get to know them or keep your distance. Never judge a book by it's cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/ROOST-UnrealEditor2025-02-0502-09-07-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1739471245\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">| A JOURNEY LIKE NO OTHER |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Getting to the town is just the start. What happens next is a mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/bloodtraingif-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__1_.gif?t=1739471245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEVELOPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The project wouldn't be possible without DaveFace's Psx Shader and Horror Engine plug-in for Unreal Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOCIAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For development updates, you can follow along on YouTube, Twitter &amp; TikTok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MUSIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All music is created by Leiwaan,  Delancey Throne &amp; Thomas Hansen.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3137450?t=1739471245","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739471245","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/caab98045c8e40a0c249779927ff2519be38d117/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739471245","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/caab98045c8e40a0c249779927ff2519be38d117/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739471245","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains scenes of explicit horror and occasional gore."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Buzz</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>7,000 Steam Wishlists!</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to everyone who has shared, commented or Wishlisted on Steam.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'ROOST' is a brief atmospheric First Person Horror-Exploration game, set in the fictional North-East English town of Mournbrough - a place harbouring dark secrets and seemingly lost to time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Player assumes the role of Declan Harker; a down-on-his-luck paranormal investigator who has been drawn to a haunting mystery where their quest for answers quickly spirals into a personal nightmare.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heavily inspired by\u00a0<i><u>P.T.</u></i>, <i><u>Paratopic</u></i><u>,\u00a0</u>\u00a0<i><u>Silent Hill</u></i>\u00a0, <u><i>Se7en</i></u>\u00a0and\u00a0<u><i>Lost Highway</i></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">| 'CRUEL BRITANNIA' ART DIRECTION |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/2024-07-2612-56-40-ezgif.com-effects.gif?t=1739471245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The games visual direction borrows heavily from PSX era, but channeled through a bleak vision of the forgotten realm of northern England.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">| IT'S GRIM UP NORTH |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A regional tale, set in the North-East of England. Inspired by the stories, perceptions and tales of the area. Welcome to Mournbrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/GhostSpook-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1739471245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">| ATMOSPHERIC WORLD AND SOUND DESIGN |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The town has many sights to see, and plenty of things you don't want to hear. Every nook and cranny has a story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/2024-07-2609-47-22-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1739471245\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">| MAKE CONVERSATION |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">People make the world go round. Get to know them or keep your distance. Never judge a book by it's cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/ROOST-UnrealEditor2025-02-0502-09-07-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1739471245\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">| A JOURNEY LIKE NO OTHER |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Getting to the town is just the start. What happens next is a mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/bloodtraingif-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__1_.gif?t=1739471245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEVELOPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The project wouldn't be possible without DaveFace's Psx Shader and Horror Engine plug-in for Unreal Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOCIAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For development updates, you can follow along on YouTube, Twitter &amp; TikTok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MUSIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All music is created by Leiwaan,  Delancey Throne &amp; Thomas Hansen.</p>","developers":["Jack Chapman"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/header.jpg?t=1739471245","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257041572,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257041572/movie480.mp4?t=1724448523","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257041572/movie_max.mp4?t=1724448523"},"name":"ROOST | Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257041572/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1724448523","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257041572/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1724448523","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257041572/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1724448523"}}],"name":"ROOST","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10 Home, Pro, Enterprise, or Education, version 1903 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 or AMD Radeon R7 370<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10 Home, Pro, Enterprise, or Education,